ecision. FOURTH-SPECIES COLLISION WATCH — THE SHAPE EXISTS AND IT IS NAMED: after R5 clause 1's IDENTITY (the ceiling is the gate), R5 clause 2's MINIMIZING CLAUSE ('strictly above' written for the wrong direction) and R7 clause 3's EMPTY DOMAIN (AUROC at n_neg=0, ruled to disqualify on the instrument-range framing), Layer 7 brings THE SELF-REPORTED DENOMINATOR: a ratio clause whose denominator §5 does not state and whose only obvious source is the engine's testimony about the capability being tested. It is WRIT's null-exemption in a new costume and R7 clause 3(a)'s ground reads naturally onto it, but clause 3 is stated ABOUT AUROC and a Stage A may not extend a holding past the clause it names — so it is a genuine gap in the ruling stock, and the shape of the fix is already visible in R7 clause 3(b): put the burden on the ARTIFACT, the denominators being the artifact's DECLARED CLASSES and not the engine's self-report. ONE MORE STRUCTURAL FINDING, recorded because §6 requires the humility trial to run 'layer N's own ascension tasks': §5 L7's humility ceiling is stated over (novel AND valid AND tagged), a per-item CONJUNCTION THAT APPEARS NOWHERE IN THE ASCENSION GATE, which states the three conjuncts separately and each as an identity — the first break in a pattern every previous layer keeps (capped cue-C against cue-C, capped weighted-C against weighted-C, capped reconstruction F against reconstruction F, capped trigger-recall against trigger-recall, capped AUROC against AUROC). So Stage A must DEFINE a measure §5 states only once and only on the capped side. README-l6 §4 already computed what it will read: the conjunction is 0 and not near 0, by arithmetic rather than by margin, because novelty requires an item provably never stored and every value that engine can return is one it holds, so the novel conjunct is false on every answer it has and the other two cannot rescue a product with a zero in it — leaving 50 permille of unexplained headroom the ladder has no precedent for reading, and the pre-read requires Stage A to take one of the two available readings explicitly rather than report '0 <= 50, ceiling holds' and move on, which is a sentence that is true of a ceiling that measures nothing. §4.2 AS IT WAKES: the provenance law binds from Layer 7 and CAN NEVER BE UN-BOUND, the only clause in the constitution that says so about itself, so Stage A is the last session that can decide anything about it cheaply. WHAT THE LAW AS WRITTEN DEMANDS: every non-abstaining answer carries a valid tag or scores WRONG (0) regardless of correctness, with support strictly ascending, non-negative, each an actually-ingested t, empty only when kind=='absent'; kind drawn from exactly {recall, aggregate, derive, absent} 'and no other'; t_asof >= 0 — a schema whose validator has existed and been exercised since [L0] (trials/laws/t_provenance_schema.py) and whose four kinds are all emitted by the engine that exists. WHAT IT CANNOT SEE, three things and each a decision waiting: (a) RECOVERABILITY — a t is 'ingested' if it was ever assigned, a fact about next_t and nothing else, while whether read(t) still ANSWERS is a state query the validator does not ask and cannot be made to ask without becoming one; (b) RELEVANCE — the schema constrains order, sign and range and never whether the cited events bear on the answer at all, so a tag citing [0,1,2] for an answer derived from [91,92] is valid, which is GAPMAP §2's recorded-but-never-binding thesis available as a defect of OUR OWN LAW and a Stage A that does not name it will have shipped it; (c) LINEAGE — there is no 'generated' kind in the closed vocabulary, and under R6 clause 2 a re-ingested generation is an actually-ingested event with a real t, so a tag citing it is schema-valid and §4.2 CANNOT DISTINGUISH SUPPORT-ON-OBSERVED FROM SUPPORT-ON-GENERATED, which is precisely the promotion §5 L7's own promotion=0 clause forbids: the provenance law as written is blind to the failure the layer that activates it exists to prevent. THE KEPT-PROMISE QUESTION LANDS HERE FORMALLY, filed at the post-L5 PULSE (line 34) and MEASURED AGAIN this arc when the fired promise's warrant became forgettable (line 35's strain pins both directions on l5stream; FIELD.md 2026-08-02 measures the same asymmetry on this project's own store, where iid 1's intend event comes back `recall` because there was room and iid 2's comes back `derive` because a pending entry regenerates it). THE PRE-READ FINDS THE COLLISION SOFTER THAN LINE 34 FEARED AND SAYS SO: for the fired event the natural support has a RECOVERABLE MEMBER — the fired event lives at its own t_fire, which the fired ledger regenerates — so an engine citing t_fire and not t0 satisfies the strict reading without Layer 5 changing anything, the constraint landing on WHICH t the Layer-7 engine cites rather than on a shape Layer 5 lawfully produces; and §7 has no 'why did this fire' query, so the case is not live today. IT BECOMES LIVE AT LAYER 7 FOR A DIFFERENT REASON, which line 34 could not see: generate(cue)'s natural support is THE MATERIAL IT COMPOSED FROM, which under Layer 4 can be regenerable-but-not-stored and under Layer 3 can be gone-but-counted, so the question stops being about promises and becomes about generation's own warrant. WHAT A STAGE A MUST DECIDE OR DRAFT, four items: settle recoverable-or-ingested (the question [L6] [DOGFOOD] deliberately REFUSED TO ARM AN INTENTION ABOUT, on the ground that it must be settled before the claim a layer-condition can see — the refusal was correct and is why the item is carried by this document rather than by a reminder that would arrive after the decision); if shape-only is the reading, SAY THE WEAKER THING OUT LOUD and measure it, the instrument being not a new gate but a REPORTED UNGATED DIAGNOSTIC — a support-recoverability rate beside the gated tagging number, in the exact shape R3 gave F_strict and R4 clause 4 gave F_corruption; declare the lineage/kind reading (generated is